   - Guilford      : 65.07% -> 64.66% (-0.41%) [Safe D]\n    - Cabarrus      : 51.50% -> 51.22% (-0.28%) [Lean D]\n    - Wilson        : 52.31% -> 52.03% (-0.28%) [Safe D]\n    - Cleveland     : 36.28% -> 36.02% (-0.26%) [Safe R]\n\n======================================================================\n7. STATEWIDE RATINGS DISTRIBUTION\n======================================================================\n  Safe D        : 20 counties (+1)\n  Very Likely D :  0 counties (-1)\n  Likely D      :  1 counties\n  Lean D        :  1 counties\n  Toss Up       :  0 counties\n  Lean R        :  1 counties (-1)\n  Likely R      :  1 counties (+1)\n  Very Likely R :  1 counties\n  Safe R        : 75 counties\n\n======================================================================\nInteractive Map: https://rannbar-on.com/beta/\nTo unsubscribe from daily updates: {{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\n======================================================================", "updated_at": "2026-10-26 17:19:04 UTC"}